## Why This Is Asked

Tests orchestration, edge cases, and cost/privacy trade-offs for multi-service AWS AI pipelines.

## Key Concepts

- Event-driven orchestration (S3 → Step Functions)
- Language detection, sentiment/abuse scoring, translation
- PII redaction and data privacy controls
- Idempotency, retries, and error handling
- Observability (CloudWatch, X-Ray, EventBridge) and cost governance

## Code Example

